{"schema":1,"run_id":"validate-muse-detq-bbaf96daa0a6-1795478139272122798-3747079-4908314b","hermit_sha":"bbaf96daa0a62bb43269bc25a638976bd43b6978","path":"only-full","compatibility_selected":false,"dag_json":"{\n  \"description\": \"Hermit validation superset; select quick, portable, hosted-portable, full, super, privileged, or hosted-privileged by step label\",\n  \"resource_caps\": {\n    \"buck_daemon\": 1,\n    \"integration_test_binaries.cli\": 1,\n    \"integration_test_binaries.hermit_modes\": 1,\n    \"manifest_guest\": 20\n  },\n  \"mem_cap_factor\": 1.25,\n  \"mem_cap_floor_bytes\": 8589934592,\n  \"outer_mem_safety_factor\": 1.0,\n  \"default_step_timeout\": 600,\n  \"default_jobs_flag\": \"-j\",\n  \"default_jobs_env\": \"\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"group\": \"pre\",\n      \"job\": \"submodules\",\n      \"desc\": \"Verify repository submodules without initializing or repairing them\",\n      \"description\": \"Checks that every gitlink HEAD records (third-party/rr, agent-utils and reverie, recursively) is declared in .gitmodules and agrees with its index entry. Ordinary entries must be their own populated repositories at exactly the recorded commit with clean worktrees. A nested entry with exactly one update=none declaration in .gitmodules instead requires an existing, completely empty directory, including no hidden files or .git. Missing directories, any content under nested update=none, ambiguous policies, failed policy or directory reads, and top-level or mutable local-config exemptions are refused. ci/verify-submodules.sh never initializes, updates or registers a submodule. Every build and test reads these checkouts, so this keeps the validation on the sources the commit records. A reverie checkout left at an older commit is refused with \\\"submodule HEAD differs from recorded gitlink\\\"; a stray untracked file inside agent-utils is refused as a dirty worktree. The checker's own self-test (these cases and its refusals of a non-repository, wrong HEAD, dirty, conflicted, symlinked, undeclared and unsafe path, on scratch repositories) runs in the leaf node selftest.verify_submodules, not here: this node is the root of every lane's critical path, and on 2026-11-21 the self-test took 86.3 s wall (72 CPU s) of it against 2.7 s for the check itself.\",\n      \"labels\": [\n        \"full\",\n        \"hosted-portable\",\n        \"portable\",\n        \"quick\",\n        \"super\"\n      ],\n      \"cmd\": \"export PATH=\\\"$PWD/ci/rust-script-bin:$PATH\\\"; export HERMIT_RUST_SCRIPT_ARTIFACT_ROOT=\\\"$PWD/target/ci/rust-scripts\\\"; export HERMIT_PREBUILT_RUST_SCRIPTS_REQUIRED=1; ./ci/verify-submodules.sh\",\n      \"result_manifests\": [],\n      \"deps\": [],\n      \"env\": {},\n      \"networkonly\": false,\n      \"engine_only\": false,\n      \"timeout\": 900,\n      \"cpu_timeout\": 300,\n      \"priority\": 50,\n      \"jobs_flag\": null,\n      \"jobs_env\": null,\n      \"hint\": {\n        \"resources\": {},\n        \"est_duration_s\": 0.0,\n        \"rss_baseline_bytes\": 2147483648,\n        \"hard_mem_max_bytes\": 2147483648,\n        \"classification\": \"light\",\n        \"preferred_inner_jobs\": null,\n        \"measured_effective_cores\": null,\n        \"measured_cpu_utilization\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"group\": \"pre\",\n      \"job\": \"reverie_pin\",\n      \"desc\": \"Reverie pin consistency\",\n      \"description\": \"Runs ci/run-reverie-pin-check.sh. scripts/check-reverie-pin.rs requires every Reverie revision in tracked Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock files, the LiteInst cache keys, the DBT budget bindings and the Buck build's pin (hermit-cli/BUCK takes it from shim/hermetic_infra/hermit/fb-only/release.bzl, whose HERMIT_VERSION must also equal hermit-cli/Cargo.toml's version) to name one commit, and refuses a pin that is not an ancestor of Reverie main or that moves backwards from the pin on origin/main (an unreachable remote blocks rather than passes); scripts/check-git-pin-uniformity.rs then refuses any git dependency or submodule gitlink recorded at two revisions. Build and test nodes depend on it so no run compiles Reverie from mixed commits. Resolving a Cargo.lock conflict to an older Reverie prints \\\"REVERIE PIN REGRESSION - BLOCKED\\\"; moving the reverie gitlink without the Cargo revisions breaks uniformity.\",\n      \"labels\": [\n        \"full\",\n        \"hosted-portable\",\n        \"portable\",\n        \"quick\",\n        \"super\"\n      ],\n      \"cmd\": \"export PATH=\\\"$PWD/ci/rust-script-bin:$PATH\\\"; export HERMIT_RUST_SCRIPT_ARTIFACT_ROOT=\\\"$PWD/target/ci/rust-scripts\\\"; export HERMIT_PREBUILT_RUST_SCRIPTS_REQUIRED=1; hermit_run_pin_check() { if command -v with-proxy >/dev/null 2>&1; then with-proxy \\\"$@\\\"; else \\\"$@\\\"; fi; }; hermit_run_pin_check ./ci/run-reverie-pin-check.sh --repo \\\"$PWD\\\"\",\n      \"result_manifests\": [],\n      \"deps\": [\n        \"pre.submodules\"\n      ],\n      \"env\": {},\n      \"networkonly\": false,\n      \"engine_only\": false,\n      \"timeout\": 900,\n      \"cpu_timeout\": 300,\n      \"priority\": 50,\n      \"jobs_flag\": null,\n      \"jobs_env\": null,\n      \"hint\": {\n        \"resources\": {},\n        \"est_duration_s\": 0.0,\n        \"rss_baseline_bytes\": 2147483648,\n        \"hard_mem_max_bytes\": 2147483648,\n        \"classification\": \"light\",\n        \"preferred_inner_jobs\": null,\n        \"measured_effective_cores\": null,\n        \"measured_cpu_utilization\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"group\": \"pre\",\n      \"job\": \"cargo_lock\",\n      \"desc\": \"Cargo.lock freshness on every OSS Cargo root\",\n      \"description\": \"Tier 1 of the two-tier Cargo.lock gate. Runs ci/run-cargo-lock-check.sh: scripts/check-cargo-lock-freshness.rs probes the Hermit root, the reverie submodule root and liteinst-runtime-build with the full `cargo metadata --locked` — never `--no-deps`, which exits 0 on a stale lock while the full probe exits 101 (measured at the design head and re-verified on facebookexperimental/hermit 262fa517 with cargo 1.97.1). A planted stale Reverie lock at that head (reverie version bumped without regenerating reverie/Cargo.lock) is refused by name with \\\"CARGO LOCK GATE: Cargo.lock IS STALE - BLOCKED\\\"; the green run on the same trees passes all three roots offline in seconds. scripts/check-nested-lockfiles.rs still covers only the nested root for the staged LiteInst build; this node is the all-roots gate whose absence let a stale Reverie Cargo.lock reach export on 2026-11-14/15. It depends on pre.submodules because the Reverie probe reads the pinned submodule checkout. Build nodes do not yet wait on it, so a red lock can waste parallel build work, but no lane carrying its labels can go green over a stale lock. It carries full, portable and hosted-portable only for now: admitting a new quick/super node also needs the quick dependency-closed source table, which is a named follow-up rather than part of this gate; its unit tests still run under check.script_unit_tests.\",\n      \"labels\": [\n        \"full\",\n        \"hosted-portable\",\n        \"portable\"\n      ],\n      \"cmd\": \"export PATH=\\\"$PWD/ci/rust-script-bin:$PATH\\\"; export HERMIT_RUST_SCRIPT_ARTIFACT_ROOT=\\\"$PWD/target/ci/rust-scripts\\\"; export HERMIT_PREBUILT_RUST_SCRIPTS_REQUIRED=1; hermit_run_lock_check() { if command -v with-proxy >/dev/null 2>&1; then with-proxy \\\"$@\\\"; else \\\"$@\\\"; fi; }; hermit_run_lock_check ./ci/run-cargo-lock-check.sh --repo \\\"$PWD\\\"\",\n      \"result_manifests\": [],\n      \"deps\": [\n        \"pre.reverie_pin\",\n        \"pre.submodules\"\n      ],\n      \"env\": {},\n      \"networkonly\": false,\n      \"engine_only\": false,\n      \"timeout\": 900,\n      \"cpu_timeout\": 300,\n      \"priority\": 50,\n      \"jobs_flag\": null,\n      \"jobs_env\": null,\n      \"hint\": {\n        \"resources\": {},\n        \"est_duration_s\